WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.138
Let’s walk through Participants.

00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:04.925
Verify each seat by team, role, display name

00:00:04.925 --> 00:00:06.438
, and connection state.

00:00:06.438 --> 00:00:10.213
Resolve duplicates, missing assignments, or reconnect ambiguity before

00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:14.300
the exercise begins and recheck after any operational interruption.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.375
On this slide, confirm every connected participant has the

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:20.500
intended team, role, display name, and current

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.913
connection state.

00:00:21.913 --> 00:00:25.575
In practice, resolve missing or duplicated seats before the

00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:29.438
exercise starts and recheck the roster after reconnects.

00:00:29.935 --> 00:00:32.935
When you are ready, use Open Participants to move

00:00:32.935 --> 00:00:34.447
to the live surface.

00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:37.185
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:37.335
.
